 "about": "A house style for agent outputs: dashboards, evaluation reports, clips and pages. Colours, type and layout motifs taken from the user's own RMD Projects Executive Dashboard. No logo, wordmark, emblem, organisation name or data of any authority; not affiliated with or endorsed by one. The dark palette, the darker green and amber, and the on-colour tokens are derived here so that every pair in contrast_pairs meets WCAG 2.2 AA (4.5:1 for text, 3:1 for chart marks); tests/test_rta_style.py checks it.",
