 "document_about": "The print variant for reports and decks: blue and white led, with red kept for the one thing to look at. It follows the Dubai Design System's principles: one type system for Arabic and English (IBM Plex Sans with IBM Plex Sans Arabic, designed together under the SIL Open Font License; Dubai where its files are supplied), hierarchy from size and weight, AA contrast, and the entity's own colours. No logo, emblem or name of any authority.",
